    "summary": "The LightRAG community is centered around the development and deployment of the LightRAG (Lightweight Representation for Active Gating) application. This community includes key entities such as the LightRAG application itself, its supporting components (ENV-BASE, ENV-SERVER, ENV-SECURITY-CHECK, and ENV-STORE), and additional infrastructure elements like SSL and HTTP/2. The relationships among these entities are crucial for the proper functioning of the LightRAG application, with each entity playing a distinct role in the software development lifecycle.",
    "rating": 7.5,
