    "title": "GraphRAG Community and Information Retrieval Systems",
    "summary": "The GraphRAG community encompasses a collection of entities focused on information retrieval and processing. This community includes sub-systems, query modes, and key personnel contributing to the development and research of the GraphRAG architecture. The relationships between these entities highlight the interconnected nature of the community, with each entity playing a distinct role in the overall ecosystem.",
    "rating": 4.5,
