        },
        {
            "summary": "Handling offline and extra dependencies",
            "explanation": "UV supports the inclusion of extra dependencies and can generate lock files for offline builds, addressing practical concerns in software development. This functionality allows developers to work without constant internet access and still maintain consistent builds. The relationships between Extra, Offline, and UV demonstrate the practicality and versatility of the tool within the community. [Data: Entities (1074, 1075); Relationships (985, 987)]"
        },
        {
            "summary": "Code reviews and build consistency",
