        },
        {
            "summary": "Environmental adaptability of the system",
            "explanation": "The system must adapt to temperature-humidity-altitude conditions, as indicated by the relationship between the Temperature-Humidity-Altitude entity and the System. This adaptability is crucial for the system's reliability and performance in various environments. The relationship between these entities highlights the importance of environmental considerations in the Knowledge Graph Community. [Data: Entities (503, 556, 557), Relationships (503, +more)]"
        },
